<title>USA: Fine Host files for two mln-shr offering.</title>
<headline>Fine Host files for two mln-shr offering.</headline>
<dateline>GREENWICH, Conn. 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fine Host Corp said on Thursday that it filed a registration statement with the Securities and Exchange Commission for a public offering of two million shares of common stock.</p>
<p>The company said it will sell 1,814,000 and 186,000 will be sold by shareholders. Fine Host plans to use the net proceeds of the offering to repay bank debt.</p>
<p>Montgomery Securities, Piper Jaffray Inc and Smith Barney will serve as underwriters in the offering.</p>
<p>Fine Host is a contract food service management company.</p>
<p>-- ((New York newsdesk 212-859-1611))</p>
